      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 42675,
      "sha256": "0786668030449342f2cdc9f631d6cf931f2a8e743dc77a9f5d0014a7234c7b4a"
    },
    {
      "id": "ac4efdc2278a7c",
      "file": "ac4efdc2278a7c.mp3",
      "text": "have a heart of gold",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 24703,
      "sha256": "bd751b1809ed55f3fa6588132e19b2033d2d94f9ea2e3b3e8a68eb53a31578b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "63c7b7aa06f2e1",
      "file": "63c7b7aa06f2e1.mp3",
      "text": "Our neighbor has a heart of gold.",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 31391,
      "sha256": "eb9e6a9739fef3fe0dcf67520b0e3e86d9d36c28a6cd6a160295cd32d3dabe39"
    },
    {
      "id": "185ce20f032826",
      "file": "185ce20f032826.mp3",
      "text": "She seems considerate because she listens carefully.",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 50199,
      "sha256": "ff4cf3f947ddaf41da7c8d966abb8406b327a5ad3f4852c85e317bbf3a8e9077"
    },
    {
      "id": "8520e52797c294",
      "file": "8520e52797c294.mp3",
      "text": "He organizes free classes, so I think he makes a difference.",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 55214,
      "sha256": "49df015e0980f91086f4479c1e2fa283713eedad6d777f0e9fe132db950053ca"
    },
    {
      "id": "f113f0a6059156",
      "file": "f113f0a6059156.mp3",
      "text": "Although he is quiet, he makes new students feel welcome.",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 55214,
      "sha256": "42355dd3e162f45990e55824193ab431cb473348e0bab1875f41f01b795e4914"
    },
    {
      "id": "cc4678a4a0c4dc",
      "file": "cc4678a4a0c4dc.mp3",
      "text": "Maya organizes a free reading group in her neighborhood. She welcomes new members and listens to their ideas. I think she is considerate because she makes time for everyone. At first, some people seem nervous, but a friendly question helps break the ice. Although Maya must be busy, she always prepares carefully. The members look interested, and several have said that they feel more confident. Her work seems simple, but it makes a difference.",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 415077,
      "sha256": "d231cb4e921dbe78391c406bc4d9b73ec37a9f632d1fe9794190532cd839762e"
    },
    {
      "id": "0235f8c4d73d21",
      "file": "0235f8c4d73d21.mp3",
      "text": "This must be satire because books cannot demand pay.",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 51035,
      "sha256": "944b1c84cfeba2f6516c8c9fac2ae8e90a108c92ef082f3e3dba2f7370ee4b71"
    },
    {
      "id": "dfec6f6550b1ec",
      "file": "dfec6f6550b1ec.mp3",
      "text": "She must be tired. She might be tired. She can’t be tired.",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 54378,
      "sha256": "7bda69f0b22a069d96fcc405a3b1f617647a435e405ec10af77f24a44e370d6d"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1a36541dc9da0",
      "file": "e1a36541dc9da0.mp3",
      "text": "She looks worried. She seems relieved.",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 35988,
      "sha256": "24c8c1b8bb70acae500154a226228075cc2b6f399d0bc540531c74c2c878ed55"
    },
    {
      "id": "74be2686292188",
      "file": "74be2686292188.mp3",
      "text": "Although she looks nervous, she might simply be concentrating.",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 59812,
      "sha256": "f2f226d8046c54a926172f98859bb481f83f0ee6bdf6b4917901022fbd1fbf1f"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb368b7800bfe4",
      "file": "cb368b7800bfe4.mp3",
      "text": "I think the new student looks nervous because she is holding her notes. She might be worried about the presentation. Although she seems quiet, she could be very friendly. The other students look interested, so the topic must be engaging. After the talk, she seems relieved. My first impression was only a guess. Now I can ask her how she feels.",
      "kind": "phrase",
      "bytes": 327306,
      "sha256": "d711ed888dc20ef00cff075a5d4f859c97846a2c427e144f922e41cb9df13865"
    }
  ]
}
